Changelog: 14-11-2026 00:49:37

Fixed. The GPU Governor test no longer names another board: it warns that a GPU governor "made for another board" is
installed, and the IOMMU test and the benchmark's help say the same without it. The benchmark's comparison list
loses that board's row. The Wi-Fi Adapter test (53) is the PS5's built-in Wi-Fi alone, its driver and firmware: the
reader of every other adapter went, as its hints named an app this suite does not have. The two system score tiles,
which were never shown on a PS5, are removed from the code. The older entries here no longer name that board.

